  "short_description": "<p>Sustainable handwoven bamboo pendant light from Vietnam. Perfect for wholesalers, interior projects, and eco-conscious retail markets.</p>",
  "description": "<p data-start=\"331\" data-end=\"519\">Add warmth and texture to your interior design collection with our <strong data-start=\"398\" data-end=\"432\">handwoven bamboo pendant light</strong>, expertly crafted in Vietnam by local artisans using traditional weaving techniques.</p>\n<p data-start=\"521\" data-end=\"835\">Each pendant is made from <strong data-start=\"547\" data-end=\"570\">100% natural bamboo</strong>, offering a lightweight yet sturdy structure that casts soft, ambient light through its intricate pattern. Perfect for interior designers, importers, and retailers seeking <strong data-start=\"743\" data-end=\"778\">eco-friendly lighting solutions</strong>, this piece blends sustainability with artisan elegance.</p>\n<p data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"1017\">Ideal for cafés, restaurants, resorts, and modern homes, these hanging lights bring a cozy, nature-inspired aesthetic while supporting responsible sourcing and rural craftsmanship.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1019\" data-end=\"1116\">We offer <strong data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1048\">OEM/ODM services</strong>, bulk production, and private labeling to meet your market’s needs.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"1118\" data-end=\"1121\" />\n<h3 data-start=\"1123\" data-end=\"1148\">✅ <strong data-start=\"1129\" data-end=\"1146\">Key Features:</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1149\" data-end=\"1559\">\n<li data-start=\"1149\" data-end=\"1233\">\n<p data-start=\"1151\" data-end=\"1233\">🌿 <strong data-start=\"1154\" data-end=\"1177\">100% Natural Bamboo</strong> – Renewable, biodegradable, and sustainably harvested</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1305\">\n<p data-start=\"1236\" data-end=\"1305\">✋ <strong data-start=\"1238\" data-end=\"1265\">Handwoven Craftsmanship</strong> – Made by skilled Vietnamese artisans</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1306\" data-end=\"1388\">\n<p data-start=\"1308\" data-end=\"1388\">💡 <strong data-start=\"1311\" data-end=\"1337\">Soft, Ambient Lighting</strong> – Beautiful shadow patterns through bamboo weave</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1389\" data-end=\"1469\">\n<p data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1469\">🛠️ <strong data-start=\"1395\" data-end=\"1411\">Customizable</strong> – Sizes, shapes, and finishes tailored for B2B partners</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1470\" data-end=\"1559\">\n<p data-start=\"1472\" data-end=\"1559\">📦 <strong data-start=\"1475\" data-end=\"1509\">Ideal for Hospitality &amp; Retail</strong> – Perfect for hotels, spas, boutiques, eco-stores</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"2081\" data-end=\"2272\">\n<hr data-start=\"2274\" data-end=\"2277\" />\n<h3 data-start=\"2279\" data-end=\"2312\"><strong data-start=\"2283\" data-end=\"2310\">For Buyers &amp; Importers:</strong></h3>\n<p data-start=\"2313\" data-end=\"2453\">We specialize in supplying <strong data-start=\"2340\" data-end=\"2355\">bulk orders</strong> and <strong data-start=\"2360\" data-end=\"2394\">custom-designed pendant lights</strong> for B2B clients in the EU, US, Japan, Australia, and more.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2455\" data-end=\"2595\">📧 <strong data-start=\"2458\" data-end=\"2468\">Email:</strong> <a class=\"cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"2469\" data-end=\"2492\">vietcraft2006@gmail.com</a><br data-start=\"2492\" data-end=\"2495\" />📞 <strong data-start=\"2498\" data-end=\"2516\">WhatsApp/Zalo:</strong> +84-975-810-168<br data-start=\"2532\" data-end=\"2535\" />🌐 <strong data-start=\"2538\" data-end=\"2550\">Website:</strong> <a class=\"\" href=\"https://www.vietcraft.vn\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"2551\" data-end=\"2595\">www.vietcraft.vn</a></p>",
